    "description_html": "<ul>\n<li>High visibility removable vinyl</li>\n<li>Waterproof</li>\n<li>Tear-resistant &amp; UV resistant</li>\n<li>Supplied on&nbsp;sheets</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Digitally printed, high visibility (Hi-Viz) removable vinyl stickers. Any size from 0.5\"x0.5\" up to 8.5\"x8.5\".</strong></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Removable vinyl stickers are </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">high-resolution, digitally printed stickers</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> with </span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">a </span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">strong but temporary adhesive</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, allowing for </span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">easy removal without residue for up to 6 months</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Designed for </span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">promotions, advertising, and temporary branding</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, these stickers feature a </span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">glossy finish, water resistance, and tear resistance</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, ensuring </span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">durability while remaining easy to remove</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>"
  },
  "assumptions": [
    "Check thresholds are the domed-sticker values from the Print MCP spec; other sticker types may need their own.",
    "sheet_in (9.25 x 10 in) is confirmed only for domed sheets (current studio + spec).",
    "white_prints_clear on Metallic and white_ink on Clear follow the product names; confirm with production.",
    "Vinyl lettering is cut from solid-color vinyl (one color, text and vector only), based on the product name 'Cut Vinyl Logos'; confirm with production."
  ],
